.TH SIGPENDING 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
sigpending \- reads pending signals using the eight-byte linux kernel signal-set layout
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <signal.h>
.B int sigpending(sigset_t* set);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads pending signals using the eight-byte Linux kernel signal-set layout.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result on success, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sigpending (2)
